{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>And you shall not make yourselves abominable through beast or bird or through anything that creeps on the ground.</b> Through the species of unclean creatures, which I have distinguished for you from the clean ones." "<b>To defile.</b> In the sense that the abominable thing defiles the soul — and this is through eating them, not through contact and carrying alone."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:37:04.983225759Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}